        "created_at": "2013-01-28T03:13:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For cards like Bunker's Grenade Launcher or AZs Hoarfrost, when you are told to pick a taget then choose a second target, can the second target be the same as he first target? &nbsp;Or are you obligated to have 2 different targets?</p>",
