        "raw": "<p>Anytime it says to pick a second target it must be a brand new target. Though say in AZ&#39;s case he could hit himself with the fire damage thus hitting&nbsp;a target for cold. Then the second target could be that target that was hit with the cold since technically AZ was the first target.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also any redirection would allow you to hit the same target more than once. Such as Bunker&#39;s Grenade launcher, it could hit 1 enemy target, then hit Mr. Fixer who happens to have driving mantis in play, thus redirecting it to the target that was hit by the first one. Or even Mr. Fixer with Driving Mantis and Dual Crowbars and no other buffs could hit a enemy then himself and redirecting to the same enemy.</p>",
